cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Emergence Lab in research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "Emergence Lab: a laboratory for artificial life"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic Rust laboratory for artificial life: Conway's Game of Life
  with dense, bit-packed, sparse and Hashlife engines, the OTCA metapixel,
  Life-like and multi-state cellular automata, Lenia and SmoothLife, 3D
  automata, an individual-based ecosystem simulator, evolution and emergent
  civilizations, with a desktop application, a headless CLI and a web demo.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alejandro
    family-names: Newport Diaz
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ale-Newport/Conway_GameOfLife"
url: "https://ale-newport.github.io/Conway_GameOfLife/"
license:
